I encourage you to get a pair of flip-flops.

1916
01:17:09.260 --> 01:17:11.180
Yeah, and I guess I have to fix my hair.

1917
01:17:11.380 --> 01:17:13.080
Well, you do have one guy that's going,

1918
01:17:14.860 --> 01:17:16.300
he's like at attention.

1919
01:17:17.260 --> 01:17:18.440
Just in your bangs.

1920
01:17:19.000 --> 01:17:20.580
I'm growing my bangs out.

1921
01:17:20.860 --> 01:17:22.480
Oh, it's a transition.

1922
01:17:22.740 --> 01:17:23.940
They're a strange length.

1923
01:17:24.720 --> 01:17:26.100
It was a summer thing.

1924
01:17:26.300 --> 01:17:27.480
We're moving into fall.

1925
01:17:28.860 --> 01:17:29.760
I have your fall hairdo.

1926
01:17:29.880 --> 01:17:30.360
That's right.

1927
01:17:30.500 --> 01:17:32.700
I'm moving into, I don't know what my fall hairdo is yet,

1928
01:17:33.320 --> 01:17:36.060
but we're transitioning out of bangs right now.

1929
01:17:36.600 --> 01:17:38.780
I can't wait to see what your fall hairdo is.

1930
01:17:38.920 --> 01:17:40.600
Well, I know I'm going to get the truth from you.

1931
01:17:40.700 --> 01:17:41.220
That's for sure.

1932
01:17:41.340 --> 01:17:41.960
That's for sure.

1933
01:17:42.380 --> 01:17:42.780
All right.

1934
01:17:42.860 --> 01:17:44.120
I love you, lady.

1935
01:17:44.500 --> 01:17:45.060
All right, guys.

1936
01:17:45.200 --> 01:17:46.160
Have a great week.

1937
